<title>USA: Food Lion Inc sets quarterly dividends.</title>
<headline>Food Lion Inc sets quarterly dividends.</headline>
<dateline>SALISBURY, N.C. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food Lion Inc declared a quarterly dividend of $0.028 per share on its class A common shares. 				 Quarterly</p>
<p>			  Latest		   Prior</p>
<p> Amount		 $0.028		  $0.028</p>
<p> Pay		    Oct 21</p>
<p> Record		 Oct 7</p>
<p>The company also declared a quarterly dividend of $0.0276 per share on its class B common shares.</p>
<p>		    Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		$0.0276		 $0.0276</p>
<p> Pay		    Oct 21</p>
<p> Record		  Oct 7</p>
</text>
